{"id":"4dac3128b8b4","createdAt":"2026-08-07T10:19:07.832Z","taskType":"explain_error","input":{"question":"Deployment 为什么提示缺少 spec.selector，应该怎么修复？"},"expected":{"sourceIds":["schema::apps/v1::Deployment::spec.selector","schema::apps/v1::Deployment::spec.selector.matchLabels"]},"actual":{"answer":"根据校验错误提示，你的 Deployment 缺少 `spec.selector` 字段，该字段**必填** [S1]。\n\n**原因**：`spec.selector` 是 Deployment 的必填字段，用于选择该 Deployment 管理的 Pod [S1]。\n\n**修复方式**：在 `spec` 下添加 `selector`，且其标签必须与 `spec.template.metadata.labels` 匹配 [S1]。你的模板标签为 `app: web`，因此 selector 应配置为：\n\n```yaml\nspec:\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: web\n```\n\n修复后的完整 `spec` 部分：\n\n```yaml\nspec:\n  replicas: 2\n  selector:\n    matchLabels:\n      app: web\n  template:\n    metadata:\n      labels:\n        app: web\n    spec:\n      containers:\n        - name: nginx\n          image: nginx:1.27\n```\n\n注意：`selector` 的标签必须与 Pod 模板的标签一致 [S1]。","sourceIds":["schema::apps/v1::Deployment::spec.selector","schema::apps/v1::Deployment::spec.selector.matchExpressions.operator","schema::apps/v1::Deployment::spec.template.spec.volumes.ephemeral.volumeClaimTemplate.spec.selector"],"evaluation":{"runId":"2026-08-04T16-45-36-640Z-targeted","scope":"targeted","outcome":"failed","unsupportedClaims":["回答在 selector 配置示例中使用了 matchLabels 字段，但允许依据 S1、S2、S3 均未提及该字段"],"judgeReason":"回答给出了修复 Deployment 缺少 spec.selector 的具体 YAML 配置，其中使用了 matchLabels 键名，但提供的允许依据仅说明 selector 是 object 类型且必填，未列出 matchLabels 字段，因此该字段名无依据。"}},"failure":{"layer":"generation","type":"unsupported_claim","note":"回答给出了修复 Deployment 缺少 spec.selector 的具体 YAML 配置，其中使用了 matchLabels 键名，但提供的允许依据仅说明 selector 是 object 类型且必填，未列出 matchLabels 字段，因此该字段名无依据。"},"severity":"high","status":"fixed","tracking":{"evalCaseId":"error-deployment-missing-selector","source":"faith_eval","firstSeenAt":"2026-08-07T10:19:07.832Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-08-07T10:19:07.832Z","lastSeenRunId":"2026-08-04T16-45-36-640Z-targeted","observedRunIds":["2026-08-04T16-45-36-640Z-targeted"],"occurrenceCount":1,"scope":"targeted","models":{"embedding":"voyage-3","rerank":"rerank-2.5","answer":"deepseek-v4-flash","judge":"deepseek-v4-pro"}},"latestEvidence":{"runId":"2026-08-04T16-45-36-640Z-targeted","traceId":"2ab21deb-9e13-4c40-8f0d-ac8e9d22ed00"}}
{"id":"afb5293dc3fc","createdAt":"2026-08-08T06:07:15.643Z","taskType":"ask_free","input":{"question":"ConfigMap 怎么设为不可变?"},"expected":{"sourceIds":["schema::v1::ConfigMap::immutable"]},"actual":{"answer":"根据提供的文档片段 [S1]，ConfigMap 可以通过设置 `immutable` 字段为 `true` 来确保其中存储的数据不可更新（只能修改对象元数据）[S1]。\n\n配置方式为：在 ConfigMap 的 spec 中设置 `immutable: true`，类型为 boolean [S1]。\n\n注意：文档片段仅说明该字段存在及其行为语义，未提供完整的 ConfigMap 资源骨架或相邻字段信息，因此无法给出完整的 YAML 示例。","sourceIds":["schema::v1::ConfigMap::immutable","schema::v1::ConfigMap::metadata.ownerReferences.blockOwnerDeletion","schema::v1::ConfigMap::metadata.name"],"evaluation":{"runId":"2026-08-07T12-13-16-784Z","scope":"tuning","outcome":"failed","unsupportedClaims":["声称 immutable 字段位于 ConfigMap 的 spec 下，但允许依据未说明字段路径"],"judgeReason":"回答给出了 ConfigMap 设为不可变的实质性操作建议（设置 immutable: true），但将字段路径指定为 spec 下，而允许依据 [S1] 仅说明 ConfigMap 有 immutable 字段，未描述其所在层级或路径，因此该路径主张无依据。"}},"failure":{"layer":"generation","type":"unsupported_claim","note":"回答给出了 ConfigMap 设为不可变的实质性操作建议（设置 immutable: true），但将字段路径指定为 spec 下，而允许依据 [S1] 仅说明 ConfigMap 有 immutable 字段，未描述其所在层级或路径，因此该路径主张无依据。"},"severity":"high","status":"fixed","tracking":{"evalCaseId":"cm-immutable","source":"faith_eval","firstSeenAt":"2026-08-08T06:07:15.643Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-08-08T06:07:15.643Z","lastSeenRunId":"2026-08-07T12-13-16-784Z","observedRunIds":["2026-08-07T12-13-16-784Z"],"occurrenceCount":1,"scope":"tuning","models":{"embedding":"voyage-3","rerank":"rerank-2.5","answer":"deepseek-v4-flash","judge":"deepseek-v4-pro"}},"latestEvidence":{"runId":"2026-08-07T12-13-16-784Z","traceId":"3797aba0-a48c-4a67-b6b6-ca21e8544fb7"}}
